      "description": "A soft semantic tone reinforces an explicit status label.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-badge\"><span class=\"ds-badge-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Calculated</span>",
      "css": ".ds-badge{font-family:var(--font-source-sans,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;white-space:nowrap;border:1px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--ok,oklch(0.45 0.11 152)) 25%,transparent);border-radius:9999px;padding:2px 8px;background:var(--ok-soft,oklch(0.955 0.038 152));color:var(--ok,oklch(0.45 0.11 152));font-size:11px;font-weight:500;}.ds-badge-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:9999px;background:currentColor;opacity:.7;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Product Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "product-card",
      "description": "A product wash groups saved-record rows and a supporting action.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-product\"><h2 class=\"ds-product-title\">Home loans</h2><p class=\"ds-product-description\">Owner occupied and investment mortgage pricing</p><a class=\"ds-product-row\" href=\"#\"><span>Sample customer</span><strong class=\"ds-product-rate\">5.52%</strong></a></section>",
      "css": ".ds-product{font-family:var(--font-source-sans,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:340px;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;background:var(--brand-soft,oklch(0.945 0.038 168));color:var(--ink,oklch(0.215 0.022 185));}.ds-product-title{font-family:var(--font-source-serif,\"Source Serif 4\"),Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:0;font-size:1.3rem;font-weight:600;}.ds-product-description{max-width:240px;margin:4px 0 24px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.625;color:var(--ink-muted,oklch(0.46 0.022 185));}.ds-product-row{display:flex;min-height:60px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--brand,oklch(0.44 0.095 168)) 15%,transparent);border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--brand,oklch(0.44 0.095 168)) 15%,transparent);color:inherit;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;}.ds-product-rate{font-family:var(--font-source-serif,\"Source Serif 4\"),Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:14px;color:var(--brand-strong,oklch(0.37 0.085 168));}.ds-product-row:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.ds-product-row:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring,oklch(0.55 0.09 168));outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Decision Band",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "decision-band",
      "description": "The signature dark surface gives the rate and repayments visual priority.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-decision\" aria-label=\"Quote decision summary\"><div><h3 class=\"ds-decision-label\">Suggested rate</h3><p class=\"ds-decision-rate\">5.52<span class=\"ds-decision-unit\">%</span></p><p class=\"ds-decision-note\">Illustrative scenario</p></div><div class=\"ds-decision-repayment\"><h3 class=\"ds-decision-label\">Indicative repayment</h3><p class=\"ds-decision-money\">$2,585 <span class=\"ds-decision-note\">monthly</span></p></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-decision{font-family:var(--font-source-sans,\"Source Sans 3\"),ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;max-width:650px;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;background:var(--brand-deep,oklch(0.235 0.045 172));color:var(--rail-ink,oklch(0.968 0.007 170));box-shadow:var(--shadow-md,0 2px 4px oklch(0.25 0.03 190 / .05),0 12px 32px -12px oklch(0.25 0.05 190 / .22));font-size:15px;}.ds-decision-label{margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--brand-deep-muted,oklch(0.74 0.035 170));}.ds-decision-rate{font-family:var(--font-source-serif,\"Source Serif 4\"),Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:8px 0 12px;font-size:46.5px;line-height:1;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand-glow,oklch(0.87 0.13 164));}.ds-decision-unit{margin-left:2px;font-size:24px;font-weight:500;color:var(--brand-deep-muted,oklch(0.74 0.035 170));}.ds-decision-note{margin:0;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;color:var(--brand-deep-muted,oklch(0.74 0.035 170));}.ds-decision-repayment{border-left:1px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--rail-ink,oklch(0.968 0.007 170)) 10%,transparent);padding-left:24px;}.ds-decision-money{font-family:var(--font-source-serif,\"Source Serif 4\"),Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;font-size:20px;font-weight:600;}@media(max-width:500px){.ds-decision{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.ds-decision-repayment{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid color-mix(in oklch,var(--rail-ink,oklch(0.968 0.007 170)) 10%,transparent);padding-left:0;padding-top:20px;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Ruled Ledger",
    "overview": "A calm, precise operating workspace: near-white paper, hairline divisions and readable figures beside a near-black evergreen rail. Source Sans 3 carries controls and explanations; Source Serif 4 supplies headings and the tabular numbers that give results their printed-ledger character.\n\nThe original product interface is the source of truth. The demo copies its components and interaction patterns, with neutral branding, fictional policy and browser-local operations. Dense forms and saved records remain legible through grouped sections, space, disclosure controls and a prominent dark decision panel.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Continuous paper-light workspace with a dark navigation rail.",
      "Evergreen, iris and azure accents distinguish lending areas.",
      "Serif tabular figures anchor rates, repayments and financial comparisons.",
      "Hairlines, restrained tint and explicit labels organize information."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Product Scope Rule",
        "body": "Product containers change brand colors; semantic success, warning, alert and information colors remain consistent across lending areas.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Aligned Figures Rule",
        "body": "Use Source Serif 4 with `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` for rates, money and comparative numeric columns.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Decision Emphasis Rule",
        "body": "Concentrate dark tonal depth and the largest luminous figures in the pricing decision panel.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do preserve the paper workspace, evergreen navigation and scoped product colors.",
      "Do use serif tabular figures for financial comparisons.",
      "Do keep visible focus, labelled status and 44px control targets.",
      "Do respect reduced motion and retain readable content in print."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't communicate review status through color alone.",
      "Don't recolor semantic status tones when switching product areas.",
      "Don't apply the decision panel's emphasis to every content section."
    ]
  }
}
